{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And you shall know, etc.</b> Meaning: now you must attain a clear knowledge <b>that I am YHWH your Elohim</b> — He who is <b>the one who brings you out from under the burdens of Egypt</b>, meaning, to place upon you the burdens of My divinity. Further, it intends to tell them that they should attend to recognizing the attributes of your Elohim, for YHWH your Elohim is a compassionate El."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:25:02.621559624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}